{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2019-11-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'ANSYS, INC. PROVIDES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'ANSYS, INC. PROVIDED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019. FOR THE QUARTER, THE COMPANY EXPECTS REVENUE IN THE RANGE OF $449.6 MILLION - $475.2 MILLION AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE IN THE RANGE OF $1.44 - $1.67. FOR THE YEAR, THE COMPANY EXPECTS REVENUE IN THE RANGE OF $1,479.3 MILLION - $1,504.9 MILLION AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE IN THE RANGE OF $4.78 - $5.01.'}